# Resume text joining

Gold standard: Classic (`resumake-classic`) plus `educationEntryLines`.

- Contact, place, and dates must use helpers in `src/utils/resumeRules.ts`. Do not hand-write `if (nextField) print separator`.
- Contact = filled items only. Classic separator ` - `. Shaded separator ` | `. Order: Classic email, phone, location, website, LinkedIn. Shaded email, phone, LinkedIn, location.
- Place = `formatPlace(name, location)` (`School, City`). No trailing comma.
- Dates = `formatDateRange` (`Mon YYYY - Mon YYYY`, ongoing = `Present`). Shaded experience may use ` | `.
- Education: `educationEntryLines`. Never print `in`. Skip empty field and score.
- Hide a section with no entries.
- PDF copies the preview. Word is `buildResumeDocx.cjs` — CSS-only fixes do not update Word.

Tests must cover: empty LinkedIn, empty field of study, empty score, location with no school.
